	(text "MOUNTING: 4x M3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ad0565e-b78d-5ba3-80c4-cba77cbc03f5")
	)
	(text "BOARD ID (GPIO32 = ID0, GPIO33 = ID1), not read by firmware yet.\nFit exactly one resistor per line. Rev 1 = 00: R9, R11 fitted; R8, R10 DNP.\nPrototype (pins floating, internal pull-ups) reads 11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "405bfa33-4c03-545f-8ffc-db2060830116")
	)
	(text "LEDs: RUN (GPIO2, strapping pin - LED+R to GND is a safe load) and DOOR (GPIO16). ~4 mA each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "47c2cf6d-ce22-5850-ae08-fb6b20cc3fcb")
	)
	(text "RELAY (GPIO5): R2 4k7 pull-down holds GPIO5 ~0.3 V during boot (internal ~45k pull-up),\nbelow Q1 Vbe -> relay cannot pull in while the ESP32 resets. J2: wire COM+NO across the opener's wall button."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "481af491-0338-5edc-9604-42f038d236be")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. Firmware unchanged: GPIO map = main/board.h. Reset/factory button = devkit Boot button (GPIO0).\n2. External 5 V (J1) and USB together only if the devkit has a diode on USB VBUS - check first.\n3. Devkit rows are 25.4 mm apart (DevKitC V4) - measure the real board before ordering PCBs.\n4. Relay output is for the opener's low-voltage push-button input. Not for mains.\n5. Bring-up checklist: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-16-carrier-pcb-schematic-design.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e50628b-ec38-5076-91c8-bbd0d7672381")
	)
	(text "POWER: 5 V in -> PTC fuse -> Schottky (reverse-polarity + USB back-feed block) -> +5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "59b8fef3-ab81-5870-a2aa-cd6e34773352")
	)
	(text "REED SWITCH (GPIO4): closed = low, open = high. 10k pull-up + 1k/100nF filter (~1 ms) + ESD at J3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7bd707d3-5183-52df-a60a-e8d6f0db968e")
	)
	(text "ESP32 DevKitC V4 (WROOM-32U) - plugs into 2x 1x19 sockets (U1 footprint)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a5c90ce7-9dd6-5851-ab05-bd115d5dff2b")
	)
	(text "DHT22 / AM2302 (GPIO22), on board. Place at the far end from U1/K1 on a slotted neck; vent the enclosure."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa9ab653-58c0-5f50-b537-18e54ccafb2d")
	)
